# Example roster for the roles in examples/roles.ini (fictional users).
#   <user> <token> [token..]   [# comment]
#   token: role | role@node,node | flag | flag@node     flags: locked nopasswd pwonly
alice            admin nopasswd                     # the operator: sudo everywhere, no password prompt
bob              admin nopasswd@node2,node3
carol            instructor
dave             student
erin             student gpu pwonly@node1           # password-only on the jump host
frank            student gpu@node3,gpu1 locked@gpu1
gina             user@node3
heidi            ops nopasswd
ivan             lab user@node2
judy             student locked                     # account kept, login blocked everywhere
